          <h3>Ohao Engine</h3>
          <div class="meta">A game engine I’m building in C++ and Vulkan</div>
          <p>Ohao Engine is my own game-engine project: you write systems in native C++, and it draws with Vulkan (a mix of fast deferred lighting and slower path tracing). What’s public today is the rendering core on GitHub. The playable parts—physics, shooting, sound, effects—are still private while I build them. It’s an engine under construction, not a finished game.</p>
